When the CMS runs with the OpenTelemetry Java agent, only requests to the REST API and the GenticsImageStore are traced. The trace of a request contains all work done for it (e.g. database statements, requests to Gentics Mesh), including jobs continued in the background. The publish process, scheduler tasks and other background work are not traced. Request spans contain the ID and login of the user, and the response header X-Trace-Id contains the ID of the trace. Set OTEL_TRACES_SAMPLER=parentbased_always_on to trace everything.
